# Cognizant Rewards Platform has NO required environment variables.
#
# The application is a fully client-side React SPA: all content, rewards, and
# state live in the bundle. Nothing is fetched from a server, so there is no
# API key or database to configure.
#
# The values below are OPTIONAL and only affect local tooling:
#
#   VITE_* vars are baked in at build time (only if you add code that reads
#   `import.meta.env.VITE_*`). Currently none are read by the app.
#
#   CAPTURE_PORT          Port used by `npm run capture:screenshots` (default 4173).
#   CAPTURE_PORT=4173
#
# Copy this file to `.env` only if you intend to change the defaults.
